OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's e-bike fire deaths ruled 
OL,4,Amisadventure                           
OL,6,FA coroner has recorded a conclusion of 
OL,7,Fmisadventure after the deaths of a     
OL,8,Fmother and two children in a flat fire 
OL,9,Fcaused by an e-bike lithium-ion        
OL,10,Fbattery.                               
OL,12,FGemma Germeney, 31, Lilly Peden, eight,
OL,13,Fand Oliver Peden, four, died after the 
OL,14,Ffire at a flat in Sackville Close,     
OL,15,FCambridge, on 30 June 2023.            
OL,17,FThe inquest in Huntingdon heard the    
OL,18,Fbattery on an e-bike owned by          
OL,19,FGermeney's partner Scott Peden was the 
OL,20,F"focus" of an investigation.           
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
